  "comboAudit": "Anchor set: every anchor is sound-initial + spelling-initial (or documented medial) from the illustrated library, cartilha-canonical for pt-BR: a-abelha, e-elefante (clear initial /e/ — estrela-class es- words rejected because initial e reduces to /i/), i-iglu, o-ovo (stressed initial /o/), u-uva (classic 'U de uva'; the illustrated noun is grapes/bunch — acceptable, the keyword names the fruit); c-casa keeps c = /k/ before a; g-gato keeps g = /g/; r-rato models the strong initial /ʁ/ (matches the sound-boxes note); s-sapo = initial /s/; x-xícara = the canonical school value /ʃ/ (needs the í tile in the vowel set — present); z-zebra = /z/. h is SILENT in pt (hora) → quiet tile; k/w/y are loanword-only letters → quiet tiles; single q never occurs without u → quiet tile, the qu digraph (queijo) carries the sound. ç never begins a word → medial anchor maçã; rr/ss/nh/lh are never word-initial or word-initial-sounding → medial anchors (carro, vassoura, ninho, coelho); ch is word-initial → chave. Anchors verified live 2026-07-16 against /image-library-webp/themes/: bee|farm animals, elephant|animals, igloo|winter, egg+grapes+cheese+apple|At the Supermarket, monkey|zoo animals, ship|vehicles, tomato|vegetables, cup+window+broom|around the house, rabbit|animals all curl 200. extraWords: ~300 high-frequency K-2 Brazilian Portuguese words (BR register: ônibus, trem, sorvete, tchau, vovó), all buildable accent-exact from the tray singles (á é í ó ê ô ã õ ç earn their tiles: é, não, mamãe, você, vovó, robô, família, limões), hand-swept for profanity/anatomy/alcohol/slur surfaces — pinto, peito, cueca, gostoso-class words excluded; mama/teta/meto follow the sound-boxes-bank sensitive flags and are excluded. nonwordTTS true (pt TTS reads pseudowords cleanly, matching the blending-board decks) — therefore neverSpeak lists the vulgar/anatomy/slur/alcohol/drug buildables (including veado, which is a real animal word but a live slur in BR classrooms) so the board never voices them.",
  "notes": "pt tray = a-z + ç + accented vowels á é í ó ê ô ã õ + digraph tiles ch/nh/lh/rr/ss/qu. â û ú omitted (no K-2 payoff at this tray size; ú words like música/número stay out of extraWords). Digraphs follow BNCC 1º/2º-ano análise fonológica: ch nh lh rr ss are the five taught first; qu included because q alone is unusable. h/k/w/y/q = quiet tiles by convention (documented in comboAudit)."
}
